Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: Replication agreements not working

Solution: Check network connectivity, firewall rules, and DNS resolution
Command: ipa-replica-conncheck --master <server>
Issue: Time synchronization problems

Solution: Ensure all servers have synchronized time using NTP/chrony
Command: chrony sources -v
Issue: Certificate issues

Solution: Verify CA certificates and renew if necessary
Command: ipa-cacert-manage list
Issue: High replication lag

Solution: Check server resources, network bandwidth, and LDAP performance
Command: ipa-replica-manage list --verbose
Issue: Split-brain scenarios

Solution: Identify the authoritative server and reinitialize others
Command: ipa-replica-manage re-initialize
